        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "GPT-6 Luna writes one sentence per image that names only what is visible: the subject, setting, lighting, and style. Each image is saved with its caption as a training pair.\n\nOpen **Caption** to change the instructions."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
